OL,3,GNEWSAFamily appeal over
OL,4,Aasbestos-related cancer death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of an "active and
OL,7,Findependent" former factory worker from
OL,8,FBradford, who died from an
OL,9,Fasbestos-related cancer, are hoping for
OL,10,Fanswers over how she was exposed to the
OL,11,Fhazardous material.
OL,13,FMaureen Wainwright spent her entire
OL,14,Fworking life at Field Packaging, one of
OL,15,FBradford's major employers, creating
OL,16,Fprinted boxes for cigarettes, whisky
OL,17,Fand perfumes.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
