OL,3,GNEWSAFamily appeal over
OL,4,Aasbestos-related cancer death
OL,5,
OL,6,FWainwright died on 27 May 2025 at the
OL,7,Fage of 84, a year after being told she
OL,8,Fhad mesothelioma, an aggressive cancer
OL,9,Fcaused by historical exposure to
OL,10,Fasbestos.
OL,12,FHer daughter Joanne Cockroft said: "She
OL,13,Fdidn't have any health issues at all
OL,14,Funtil this diagnosis and when we looked
OL,15,Fit up we just didn't know how to tell
OL,16,Fher."
